  "title": "Hamilton Announces Executive Appointments",
  "summary": "PEMBROKE, BERMUDA, June 17, 2025 — Hamilton Insurance Group, Ltd. (NYSE: HG) (“Hamilton” or the “Company”) today announced the appointments of Adrian Daws to Chief Executive Officer, Hamilton Re, based in Bermuda, and Alex Baker to Chief Executive Officer, Hamilton Global Specialty, based in London, succeeding Daws. Both appointments are subject to requisite regulatory approvals, […]",
